:: rohit_morning_talk
Rohit surfaces from sleep the way a submarine surfaces   slowly, with mechanical groaning. One eye opens.

<div class="dialogue">"Bhai. Kitne baje hain?"<span class="gloss-en">Bro. What time is it?</span></div>

"Six forty-five."

<div class="dialogue">"Kyun? Krishnan ki class gyaarah baje hai."<span class="gloss-en">Why? Krishnan's class is at eleven.</span></div>

"Lecture das baje hai, Rohit."<span class="gloss-en">The lecture is at ten, Rohit.</span>

He stares at the ceiling. Processes. "Fuck." He sits up in three separate attempts, reaches for last night's protein shake, takes a swig, winces. "Khatta ho gaya."<span class="gloss-en">It's gone sour.</span> Takes another swig. "Protein protein hota hai, bhai. Fresh ya expired."<span class="gloss-en">Protein is protein, bro. Fresh or expired.</span>

This is the man you share eighteen square metres with. God has a sense of humour and it's extremely specific.

<<hubreturn>>


:: landlord_interaction
Sharma uncle opens the door in his undershirt, reading glasses on a nose that's seen sixty Pune monsoons.

<div class="dialogue">"Paani ka bill badhega next month se. Swimming pool banaya hai kya bathroom mein? Aur woh tumhara dost   raat ko 2 baje gym ka bag phenk ke kya baja raha tha? Meri wife ko neend se uthaana   capital offense hai, Arjun."<span class="gloss-en">The water bill goes up next month. Have you built a swimming pool in the bathroom? And that friend of yours   throwing his gym bag around at 2 AM, what was that racket? Waking my wife from her sleep   that's a capital offense, Arjun.</span></div>

"Sorry uncle. I'll tell him."

<div class="dialogue">"Aur rent. Is hafte tak. Paisa ped pe nahi ugta."<span class="gloss-en">And the rent. By this week. Money doesn't grow on trees.</span></div>

The door closes. From inside: //"Kaun tha?" "Woh Arjun. Accha ladka hai, par uska dost..."//<span class="gloss-en">"Who was it?" "That Arjun. Good boy, but his friend..."</span>

<<hubreturn>>


:: raju_phone_sidequest
<<if setup.has("raju_phone_fixed")>>\
Raju bhaiya waggles the phone at you   screen still cracked, because Anwar bhai's shop opens at eleven. "Baba, kal le jaana. Aur chai   tera toh free hai ab. Ek hafta."<span class="gloss-en">Take it tomorrow. And tea   yours is free now. For a week.</span> He's told three customers already.
<<hubreturn>>
<<else>>\
The screen is a spiderweb radiating from the top-left corner   dropped on concrete at terminal velocity. A Redmi, two generations old. You turn it in your hands. The LCD isn't bleeding; the digitiser might still work behind the cracks.

<div class="dialogue">"Screen replace karana padega, Raju bhaiya. Katraj mein Anwar bhai   ₹800 se ₹1000."<span class="gloss-en">The screen will need replacing, Raju bhaiya. Anwar bhai in Katraj   ₹800 to ₹1000.</span></div>

<div class="dialogue">"Itna?" His mustache droops. For him that's two days of chai.<span class="gloss-en">That much?</span></div>

"Wait. Main uska regular hoon   Rohit ka phone bhi wahan fix karwaya tha. Discount mil jaayega. Aur abhi backup le leta hoon   WhatsApp, contacts, sab safe."<span class="gloss-en">I'm a regular of his   I got Rohit's phone fixed there too. He'll give a discount. And I'll take a backup now   WhatsApp, contacts, all safe.</span>

You pull the backup over an OTG cable to the spare drive in your laptop bag. His contact list is a time capsule: //Arun 2 cutting. Pramod special ginger. VIT boys table 3.//

<div class="dialogue">"Tu kar sakta hai? Baba, tujhe free chai milegi zindagi bhar."<span class="gloss-en">You can do it? Son, you'll get free tea for life.</span></div>

"Ek hafte ke liye chalega."<span class="gloss-en">A week will do.</span> You grin.

<<run setup.flag("raju_phone_fixed")>>
<<hubreturn>>
<</if>>


:: panwala_interaction
Panwala Bhau runs a glass cabinet of tobacco, gutka and dreams. Gold chain, red tilak, an Amitabh Bachchan mustache.

<div class="dialogue">"Arjun beta! Sun   kal raat police van aayi thi. Sinhagad Road pe. Bike racing, 200 pe. VIT ka ladka tha shayad. Apne doston ko bol   raat ko speed mat karo."<span class="gloss-en">Arjun, son! Listen   a police van came last night. On Sinhagad Road. Bike racing, at 200. Was a VIT boy, probably. Tell your friends   don't speed at night.</span></div>

<<if setup.hasItem("panwala_packet") or setup.has("panwala_delivery_done")>>\
<<hubreturn>>
<<else>>\
<div class="dialogue">"Ek kaam tha. VIT ke gate pe Patil guard   uska packet ready hai. Ek Classic Milds. Tu jaa raha hai toh de dega? Pachaas rupay."<span class="gloss-en">One favour. Guard Patil at the VIT gate   his packet is ready. One Classic Milds. If you're going, will you drop it? Fifty rupees.</span></div>

<div class="choices">
<<link "Take the packet   easy ₹50">>
